  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "exam_task",
      "when": {
        "category": "field"
      },
      "text": "win a fight in the field, and then tell me what you did. Use its proper name. Most people cannot."
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_task",
      "when": {
        "category": "table"
      },
      "text": "sit down with someone who wants something from you, and do not get up until there is an agreement. Then tell me what you did."
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_task",
      "when": {
        "category": "road"
      },
      "text": "the next time the road asks you something, answer it. Then tell me what you did, which will not be the same thing."
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_title",
      "when": {
        "n": "1"
      },
      "text": "The First Examination"
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_title",
      "when": {
        "n": "2"
      },
      "text": "The Second Examination"
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_followup",
      "when": {
        "n": "1"
      },
      "text": "Then, before the Sending closes: 'The second examination stands as set.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "exam_followup",
      "when": {
        "n": "2"
      },
      "text": "Then, before the Sending closes: 'The third I will set in person, at the edge. Come out when you are ready to sit it.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "curriculum",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'She set a curriculum last time as well. The strike is in the same place.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "fifteen",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same seventeen lines. The same bare number. She has still not written it down.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "inside",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same corrections, in the same order. The chalk still does not mark.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {},
      "text": ""
    }
